              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "AZEELE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Since this recipe had such high reviews I thought it would be \"safe\" to make for a party the next day. I followed the directions exactly and I should have mixed the softened cream cheese first. I should have known that. It's not my first time in the kitchen. But - what I got when I mixed everything together was a lumpy mess that looked like cottage cheese mixed with salsa. I can't serve that for a party!",
